# ON_CONSUME — he EATS it or DRINKS it, and when he has FINISHED, the wish happens. A real
# food or drink (a cookie, bread, a potion…) built with base_item: vanilla eats it exactly as it
# always does — the crunching, the hunger, the bottle left behind — and WishShapeEvents runs act() as
# him the moment the eating or drinking finishes. A wish about him happens on him; one about
# something else happens a few steps along his line of sight, as for a right-click (the AIM line).
import common

function give()
${GIVES}
    /tellraw @s {"text":"${GIVE_MESSAGE}","color":"${HEX}"}
end

function act()
    ${AIM}
end

${EFFECT_BLOCK}
